# Third-party notices

`smeltr` is distributed as a single statically linked binary. Everything
below is compiled into it and is reproduced here to satisfy the attribution
its license asks for.

Regenerate with `just notices` after any dependency change.

## Vendored C libraries

These are compiled from source into the binary by their `-sys` crates. The
crate's own license covers the Rust wrapper only; what follows is the
license of the code that actually ships.

| library | via | license |
| --- | --- | --- |
| AWS-LC (FIPS) | `aws-lc-fips-sys` | ISC AND (Apache-2.0 OR ISC) AND OpenSSL |
| OpenSSL 3.x | `openssl-src` | Apache-2.0 |
| librdkafka | `rdkafka-sys` | BSD-2-Clause, plus its own bundled components |
| SQLite | `libsqlite3-sys` | public domain |
| zstd | `zstd-sys` | BSD-3-Clause (dual-licensed BSD-3-Clause or GPL-2.0; the BSD option is taken) |
| zlib | `libz-sys` | Zlib |
| Cyrus SASL | `sasl2-sys` | CMU, BSD-4-Clause-style -- see the acknowledgment below |
| MIT Kerberos | `krb5-src` | MIT/BSD-style, 45 copyright holders in `krb5/NOTICE` |
| jemalloc (outside Windows) | `tikv-jemalloc-sys` | BSD-2-Clause |
| mimalloc (Windows) | `libmimalloc-sys` | MIT |

Cyrus SASL is the one license here that asks for more than a reproduced
notice. Its clause 4 requires this sentence in any redistribution, so it is
stated rather than referenced:

> This product includes software developed by Computing Services at Carnegie
> Mellon University (http://www.cmu.edu/computing/).

librdkafka bundles cjson, crc32c, fnv1a, hdrhistogram, lz4, murmur2, nanopb,
opentelemetry, pycrc, queue, regexp, snappy, tinycthread and wingetopt, each
under its own permissive notice; `librdkafka/LICENSES.txt` in that crate
carries the full set.

## Bundled fonts

The GUI ships its own faces rather than fetching them, so a leader inside an
enclave renders as designed -- and because a stylesheet that never resolves
blocks the script that mounts the app, not merely its typography. The files
are embedded with the rest of `gui-frontend/dist`.

| face | via | license |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Geist | `@fontsource/geist` | SIL Open Font License 1.1 |
| IBM Plex Sans | `@fontsource/ibm-plex-sans` | SIL Open Font License 1.1 |
| IBM Plex Mono | `@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono` | SIL Open Font License 1.1 |

All three carry the same license text, reproduced once below, under their
copyright notices:

> Copyright 2024 The Geist Project Authors (https://github.com/vercel/geist-font)

> Copyright 2019 IBM Corp. All rights reserved. (IBM Plex Sans)

> Copyright 2017 IBM Corp. All rights reserved. (IBM Plex Mono)

